        "english_name": "Tagalog",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "\"The Heart of Music” follows the story of the fun-loving, curly-haired Yaya Madonna, a breadwinner who was orphaned by her mother. After being scammed by an illegal recruiter, she pretends to have gone abroad so her father (played by PJ Abellana) won’t worry. She is eventually forced to work as a nanny for the eight children of couple Diana (Isay Alvarez) and Frank Riviera (Robert Seña). This is where the story’s many twists and turns begin to unfold.  Ang \"The Heart of Music\" ang kwento ng masayahing si Yaya Madonna, isang masayang at kulot ang buhok, isang kamag-anak na naulila ng kanyang ina. Matapos lokohin ng isang ilegal na recruiter, nagkunwari siyang nangibang-bansa para hindi mag-alala ang kanyang ama (ginagampanan ni PJ Abellana). Kalaunan ay napilitan siyang magtrabaho bilang yaya para sa walong anak ng mag-asawang Diana (Isay Alvarez) at Frank Riviera (Robert Seña). Dito nagsisimula ang maraming twist at turno ng kwento.",
          "runtime": 106,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      }
    ]
